# .trivyignore
# Security vulnerability suppression policy for Server Health Monitor API.
#
# Rules for entries:
# Every entry must include:
#   1. Valid CVE Identifier (e.g. CVE-YYYY-NNNNN)
#   2. Detailed technical justification / reason why the vulnerability is not exploitable in this runtime
#   3. Responsible engineer / owner
#   4. Explicit review / expiration date
#
# Format:
# CVE-YYYY-NNNNN # Reason: <reason> | Owner: <owner> | Review: <YYYY-MM-DD>
#
# Currently zero CVE exceptions are approved; any fixable HIGH or CRITICAL vulnerability fails the build.

